From 3a4f697e71b392c3cdfec6d776d289525aa94797 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bvchess <53128914+bvchess@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:58:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Gf2Frames keeps a state's frames and its candidates'
 vectors, and builds the GF(2) graph of an instance with dropped factors by
 making again only the frames whose moves lose a factor (Gf2Graph::new is the
 instance with none); e1_smooth builds its instances from it, caches 256 a
 worker, and --probe-live K stops a chain's probes after K live children S in
 a row

---
 solver/frame/examples/e1_smooth.rs |  34 ++++++----
 solver/frame/src/gf2.rs            | 102 +++++++++++++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)

